---
// src/components/campaigns/FAQ.astro
---
<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200/60" id="faq">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Questions before you book
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <!-- Q1 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden open:border-purple-200 open:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 sm:p-6 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Which versions of Tally does it work with?
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-purple-600">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 sm:pb-6 text-slate-600 font-medium text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          AI Accountant works with TallyPrime. The connection is safe and does not change your existing data.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q2 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden open:border-purple-200 open:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 sm:p-6 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Is my financial data safe?
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-purple-600">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 sm:pb-6 text-slate-600 font-medium text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Yes. We are ISO 27001:2022 and SOC 2 Type II certified. Your data is encrypted and never shared.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q3 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden open:border-purple-200 open:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 sm:p-6 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Do I need to change how my team works in Tally?
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-purple-600">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 sm:pb-6 text-slate-600 font-medium text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          No. AI Accountant posts into your current Tally setup. Your team reviews and approves just like before. There is no data migration.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q4 -->
      <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden open:border-purple-200 open:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-5 sm:p-6 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          What happens in the demo?
          <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180 text-purple-600">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 sm:pb-6 text-slate-600 font-medium text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          A specialist shows you AI Accountant on a live Tally setup and answers your questions. You see exactly how it fits your books before you decide.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
